      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好啦，趕緊帶著剩下的人避難去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃，恩人您？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？沒關係，我腳步很輕，它們發現不了我的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "（就這身手，腳步輕就能解釋得了嗎！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之後......該怎麼迅速削減這些墨魎的數量呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咿呀！園、園子裡的火光是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "唔哦！火光沖天，蔚為壯觀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "唔？莫非“炎熔”二字，便取此中意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......幫我確定附近所有敵人的分佈範圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼大陣仗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "本來擔心波及到周遭的建築，一直不怎麼敢隨便用法術......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......但敵人太多了，這樣慢吞吞對付下去，受害者數量恐怕難以估量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明白，特殊時期特殊手段嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去找個高處，你就安心施法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有超出法術範圍的敵人我都會幫忙解決的，保證一個不落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "之後的任務報告我來提交......畢竟羅德島該幫助的，不止是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "怎麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......沒什麼，在此之前，小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有看到煮傘先生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
